<title>FRANCE: France Telecom to give IPO timetable today.</title>
<headline>France Telecom to give IPO timetable today.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>France Telecom will on Wednesday announce the time table for its partial privatisation at a news conference starting 1300 GMT, a company spokesman said.</p>
<p>The timetable, with an expected stake of between 25 and 40 percent being sold by the government in the next few weeks, will be announced by chairman Michel Bon.</p>
<p>France Telecom will also announce its 1996 results.</p>
</text>
